    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d850">

                <pb facs="1057" n="961" xml:id="pg961"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Flay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-11-29T15:15:00+00:09"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 29, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 31.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Spanish Commissioners at to-day’s conference presented a definite and final
                    acceptance of our last proposition. Next meeting on Wednesday, at which time we
                    will present articles on other matters. They expressed a desire to reach a
                    conclusion promptly. We hope to make good progress from this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-11-29T15:15:00+00:09">Monday afternoon,
                        3.15</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
